\[\text{dcaV0ToPrimVertex}=\sqrt{\text{dcaXiToPrimVertex}}+A+B*\left(1-\frac{1}{1+ \text{exp}(-C*\text{p}_{T}+D)}\right) \tag{4.4}\]

